     5  ## Find the current contract and owner
     6
     7  - Use [README.md](README.md) for orientation and command entry points. Consult the affected sections of [the master product contract](outputs/AhoiBrowser-Master-Zielprompt.md) for scope or product decisions; it remains normative subject to its more specific current decisions and gates.
